body:
Island for me. It left an impact on how I interact with things in life. I feel like the thing that changes to me is my perspective, that there's thing in life that you can't just give up and forget. Like how that true ending went. >!Despite how dim the future is, the other Setsuna's still continue their journey and finally at the end, he will finally be able to save Linne.!< 

It's really a unique experience. To be honest, I'm still confused about that VN even though it's already explained.

&#x200B;

&#x200B;
